# Baseline B-10 (F-15): the SUCCESS that ends a fully pulled auto-commit
# result carries t_last and db "neo4j". Only that ending SUCCESS's t_last
# (presence) and db are pinned; type, bookmark and stats are not.
!: BOLT 4.4
!: AUTO HELLO
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: RUN "RETURN 1 AS x" {} {}
   PULL {"n": -1}
S: SUCCESS {"fields": ["x"]}
   RECORD [1]
   SUCCESS {"t_last": "*", "db": "neo4j"}
